    <h2 id="personal-wallpaper-use">Personal wallpaper use</h2>
    <p>To the extent the developer holds the necessary rights, you may download the village wallpaper from this website, use it as a wallpaper on your personal devices and keep backup copies for that purpose, without payment.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The permission is for personal, non-commercial wallpaper use.</li>
      <li>You may share the <a href="/wallpaper">official wallpaper page</a> with others.</li>
      <li>This permission does not cover selling the wallpaper, republishing the files, bundling them into another product or licensing them to others. Ask the developer before those uses, and obtain any necessary third-party permissions separately.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The village wallpaper uses AI-assisted imagery upscaled to 3840 × 2400 and is inspired by Digimon World 1. It is fan-made, contains no baked-in characters and is offered as a compatibility preview.</p>

