    <h2>Permissions and rights concerns</h2>
    <p>For a reuse request or a copyright concern, contact the developer through the <a href={links.discord} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MacDigiPet Discord community</a>. Identify the material and the use or concern so it can be reviewed. Ask for a private contact route before sharing confidential information or ownership documents.</p>
